  "docker build builds wherever docker points. When docker uses Fabo, builds run on Fabo.": "docker build 跟随 docker 当前使用的引擎；docker 使用 Fabo 时在 Fabo 上构建。",
  "docker build builds wherever docker points, so %s's builds stay there. When docker uses Fabo, builds run on Fabo.": "docker build 跟随 docker 当前使用的引擎，%s 的构建留在那里；docker 使用 Fabo 时在 Fabo 上构建。",
  "docker build and docker compose build run on Fabo, and the images are in Fabo.": "docker build 和 docker compose build 都在 Fabo 上运行，镜像在 Fabo 里。",
  "docker build and docker compose build run on Fabo, and the images are in Fabo, where %s doesn't see them.": "docker build 和 docker compose build 都在 Fabo 上运行，镜像在 Fabo 里，%s 看不到。",
  "Fabo's builder %s isn't set up yet; builds go to it once it is.": "Fabo 的构建器 %s 还没建好，建好后构建会交给它。",
  "Another builder has been picked since (docker buildx use). Choose Fabo again to build on Fabo.": "之后又选了别的构建器（docker buildx use）。再选一次 Fabo 才会回到 Fabo 构建。",
  "A switch applies at once, in terminals already open too. Switching back to Docker puts docker's build settings back as they were before Fabo changed them.": "切换立即生效，已打开的终端也一样。切回 Docker 会把 docker 的构建设置恢复成 Fabo 改动之前的样子。",
  "Couldn't change which builder docker build uses: ": "无法更改 docker build 使用的构建器：",
  "You already have %s. Which should build your images?": "这台电脑上已有 %s。用哪个来构建镜像？",
  "Keep building with Docker: docker build works as it does now, and the images stay in %s.": "继续用 Docker 构建：docker build 照旧，镜像留在 %s。",
  "Build with Fabo: docker build and docker compose build run on Fabo, and the images are in Fabo, where %s doesn't see them.": "用 Fabo 构建：docker build 和 docker compose build 在 Fabo 上运行，镜像在 Fabo 里，%s 看不到。",
  "You can switch any time in Settings → Builds.": "随时可以在 设置 → 构建 里切换。",
  "Build with Fabo": "用 Fabo 构建",
  "Keep building with Docker": "继续用 Docker 构建",
