  "Restart WSL?": "重启 WSL？",
  "WSL stops completely: every WSL distro shuts down, not only Fabo's. Fabo's engine then starts again, and containers come back as their restart policies say.": "WSL 会完全停止：所有 WSL 发行版都会关闭，不只是 Fabo 的。之后 Fabo 的引擎重新启动，容器按各自的重启策略恢复。",
  "Kept under [wsl2] in .wslconfig in your user folder and shared by every WSL distro; the rest of the file stays as it is.": "保存在用户目录的 .wslconfig 的 [wsl2] 中，所有 WSL 发行版共用；文件里的其他内容保持不变。",
